		"name": "Lustia UAT — auth-service",
		"description": "Full endpoint collection untuk testing UAT di http://43.129.55.236:8080.\n\n## Cara pakai\n1. Import file ini ke Postman.\n2. Set variabel `super_email` + `super_password` (super-admin), `tenant_email` + `tenant_password` (tenant-admin), dst.\n3. Jalankan request **Login** — token disimpan otomatis ke variable.\n4. Request lain memakai Bearer token via `{{super_token}}` atau `{{tenant_token}}`.\n\n## Catatan\n- Semua tenant-scoped endpoint memakai `{{tenant_token}}`.\n- Public booking/branch endpoints tidak butuh JWT.\n- Webhook iPaymu di-mock; untuk test pakai endpoint dummy-trigger.\n",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
